com> wrote:
>
> On Mon, Mar 31, 2025, Xin Li (Intel) wrote:
> > Signed-off-by: Xin Li (Intel) <xin@zytor.com>
> > ---
> >  arch/x86/include/asm/msr-index.h |  6 ++++++
> >  arch/x86/kvm/vmx/vmenter.S       | 28 ++++++++++++++++++++++++----
> >  2 files changed, 30 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)
